cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite this software version and companion aggregate data DOI 10.5281/zenodo.24029126. The code/data DOIs were reserved at package preparation; publication was not yet confirmed in this snapshot."
type: software
title: "Rice–Maize GPP Conditional Pooling Analysis Code"
version: 1.0.0
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24029095"
abstract: >-
  H2 aggregate regeneration code for the retrospective comparison of crop-specific,
  unconditioned pooled and crop-conditioned pooled daily GPP models in Korean rice
  and US maize. The package regenerates reported tables and figures from archived
  aggregate results. Source and archive identifiers are documented separately.
authors:
